          "en": "everything works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 104.03999999999999,
          "end": 107.46000000000001,
          "en": "And in this project here, we get a bunch of components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.46000000000001,
          "end": 110.88,
          "en": "a bunch of components working together as always.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.88,
          "end": 115.14,
          "en": "And definitely feel free to explore this project code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.14,
          "end": 116.91,
          "en": "and this component structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 116.91,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "But in the end, we just have a bunch of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 122.25,
          "en": "that are responsible for rendering these buttons,",
