        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.25,
          "end": 125.55,
          "en": "these icons on the buttons, the counter values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.55,
          "end": 128.58,
          "en": "the header here, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 128.58,
          "end": 131.46,
          "en": "Now, of course, all these components that we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.46,
          "end": 134.73,
          "en": "for example, the app component, are being rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.73,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "to the screen, otherwise, we wouldn't be able to see them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 141,
          "en": "And as you already learned in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141,
          "end": 145.71,
          "en": "rendering a component to the screen in the end simply means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.71,
          "end": 149.97,
          "en": "that React goes ahead and executes this component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 149.97,
          "end": 152.79,
          "en": "So the app component function, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.79,
          "end": 155.67000000000002,
          "en": "and it starts with the app component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.67000000000002,
          "end": 158.25,
          "en": "in this project because the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.25,
          "end": 161.52,
          "en": "is the first component and the only component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.52,
          "end": 164.97,
          "en": "that's being referenced here in the main JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.97,
          "end": 168.57,
          "en": "which is the first code file to be executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.57,
          "end": 170.73,
          "en": "when the website loads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.73,
          "end": 173.1,
          "en": "And here, we're creating this root object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.1,
          "end": 176.19,
          "en": "and we're rendering the app component to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.19,
          "end": 178.68,
          "en": "And it's because of this code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.68,
          "end": 182.883,
          "en": "that this app component function gets executed by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.01,
          "end": 188.67,
          "en": "Now, as I explained before in this course, this then means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.67,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "that all this code in there gets executed step-by-step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.72,
          "end": 195.09,
          "en": "And in case of the app component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.09,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "that, for example, means that two pieces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 201.72,
          "en": "of state are registered for this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 201.72,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "and then all the other code gets executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 208.07999999999998,
          "en": "so these functions here get created, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 208.07999999999998,
          "end": 213.07999999999998,
          "en": "Important, they get created, not executed yet, just created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.81,
          "end": 217.02,
          "en": "And then this JSX code here gets executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.02,
          "end": 221.34,
          "en": "so that, in the end, it can be returned by this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.34,
          "end": 224.01,
          "en": "And as you learned, every component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.01,
          "end": 227.25,
          "en": "must return something that can be rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.25,
          "end": 230.64,
          "en": "typically JSX code, sometimes also a portal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.64,
          "end": 234.24,
          "en": "or something like this, but here, it's some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.24,
          "end": 237.54,
          "en": "And therefore, of course, this JSX code is, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.54,
          "end": 241.05,
          "en": "translated to JavaScript code and translated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 244.53,
          "en": "to actual elements that can be rendered on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 246.393,
          "en": "that's what React is doing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 250.77,
          "en": "Now, in this JSX code here, we see a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 250.77,
          "end": 255.18,
          "en": "of built-in components, some native HTML elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.18,
          "end": 258.24,
          "en": "like main, section, h2, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.24,
          "end": 261.03,
          "en": "So all these blue components that start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.03,
          "end": 263.703,
          "en": "with the lowercase characters, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.08,
          "end": 267.51,
          "en": "And then we also have some custom components in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.51,
          "end": 272.22,
          "en": "that start with uppercase characters, Header and Counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.22,
          "end": 276.65999999999997,
          "en": "And whenever such custom components are encountered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 276.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.57,
          "en": "in JSX code that's being executed, like here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.57,
          "end": 282.51,
          "en": "this code that's returned, React goes ahead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 282.51,
          "end": 286.95,
          "en": "and also executes those component functions from top",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.95,
          "end": 290.90999999999997,
          "en": "to bottom, so starting with the header component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 290.90999999999997,
          "end": 293.13,
          "en": "Before executing the rest of this code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 293.13,
          "end": 296.37,
          "en": "React will reach out to this header component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 296.37,
          "end": 299.913,
          "en": "and execute this function and all the code that's in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 301.02,
          "end": 303.66,
          "en": "Now, in this case, it's a very simple function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 303.66,
          "end": 308.49,
          "en": "which then just returns some JSX code that consists only",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 308.49,
          "end": 312.57,
          "en": "of built-in elements and therefore, at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 312.57,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "React is done with this part of the component tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 319.23,
          "en": "because as you also learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 319.23,
          "end": 321.9,
          "en": "React constructs a component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 321.9,
          "end": 325.47,
          "en": "And for example, for this application, this means that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 325.47,
          "end": 327.96,
          "en": "at the top, we have the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 327.96,
          "end": 332.13,
          "en": "and then as one child, we have this Header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.13,
          "end": 333.96,
          "en": "But since this Header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 333.96,
          "end": 337.59000000000003,
          "en": "then does not contain any other custom components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 337.59000000000003,
          "end": 340.92,
          "en": "this branch of the tree ends here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 340.92,
          "end": 343.74,
          "en": "But it's not the tree overall that ends",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 343.74,
          "end": 345.33,
          "en": "because in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 345.33,
          "end": 348.57,
          "en": "we also have this Counter component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 348.57,
          "end": 350.15999999999997,
          "en": "So therefore, React, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 350.15999999999997,
          "end": 353.61,
          "en": "also goes ahead and executes this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 353.61,
          "end": 356.76,
          "en": "and since this component also receives a prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 356.76,
          "end": 361.65,
          "en": "React also forwards this value here, chosenCount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 361.65,
          "end": 366.65,
          "en": "which is some state I'm managing here in the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 366.87,
          "end": 371.87,
          "en": "React passes this value through this prop to this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 373.23,
          "end": 376.593,
          "en": "when executing this Counter component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 377.61,
          "end": 380.55,
          "en": "So it's this Counter component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 380.55,
          "end": 383.19,
          "en": "that's being executed, this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.19,
          "end": 385.89,
          "en": "and again, it's executed from top to bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 385.89,
          "end": 387.87,
          "en": "For example, this function here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.87,
          "end": 390.15,
          "en": "which determines whether this initialCount",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 390.15,
          "end": 393.39,
          "en": "is a prime number or not, is being executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 393.39,
          "end": 397.2,
          "en": "Some state is registered, some functions are created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 397.2,
          "end": 399.33,
          "en": "but not executed yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 399.33,
          "end": 403.44,
          "en": "And then this JSX code here is executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 403.44,
          "end": 407.58,
          "en": "So the Counter component was added to the component tree,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 407.58,
          "end": 411.78,
          "en": "but of course, this Counter component in its JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 411.78,
          "end": 415.23,
          "en": "then also contains more components which, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 415.23,
          "end": 418.68,
          "en": "also are executed by React and which are added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 418.68,
          "end": 420.45,
          "en": "to the component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 420.45,
          "end": 424.44,
          "en": "So these two buttons here, these two IconButton components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 424.44,
          "end": 427.8,
          "en": "are added to the tree below the Counter component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 427.8,
          "end": 430.953,
          "en": "and the CounterOutput component is added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 432.15,
          "end": 436.35,
          "en": "Now, these IconButtons actually receive another component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 436.35,
          "end": 438.87,
          "en": "through a prop as an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 438.87,
          "end": 442.26,
          "en": "And then inside of these IconButton components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 442.26,
          "end": 445.5,
          "en": "or in this component file, this then gets rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 445.5,
          "end": 448.17,
          "en": "as a custom component, so this icon",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
